atively low infection rate and a rather ordinary taste. Its anatomical structure is different from that of wild slugs.","abilities":["Flees when HP is under 50%! Gains bonus Movement Speed and cannot be blocked for a period of time."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":200,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.7}},"berry_slug":{"slug":"berry_slug","name":"Berry Slug","icon":"/enemies-icons/Berry Slug.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A creepy-crawly that lives in a mild environment, forming a symbiotic relationship with a particular species of plant. The berries it bears have a complex flavor, and are a rare delicacy.","abilities":["Releases a blinding gleam upon taking damage, stunning surrounding allies for an extended period before attempting to escape via digging.","Drops <Shiny Berry> if defeated before escaping."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":5400,"atk":null,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"tri_maw":{"slug":"tri_maw","name":"'Tri-Maw'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Tri-Maw'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A giant hound with a rumbling tummy and three heads, each craving something different. Satisfy its picky palates to survive!","abilities":["[Picky Palates] Clears all ingredients in the <Really Big Pot> at the start of each phase. Ingredients can only be added by defeating designated enemies. The current phase can be skipped by serving it a satisfying meal.","Upon reaching the <Really Big Pot> without being subdued, if meal is not ready, deduct 1 Life Point.","Takes less Physical and Arts damage based on the amount of ingredients in the <Really Big Pot>. The fewer ingredients there are, the less damage is taken.","Becomes enraged when HP drops below 50%, greatly increasing ATK and Movement Speed, and becoming immune to most control effects.","Forcibly adding special ingredients to the pot will cause it to get angry and refuse the meal, immediately enraging it and causing it to take less Physical and Arts damage.","'This One!'","[Predation] After several attacks, the next attack deals increased Physical damage while lowering the target's DEF.","'That One!'","[Howl of Hunger] Lets out an ear-splitting howl, stunning nearby allies and immediately waking all <Berry Slugs> and <Fruit Slugs> on the field.","'Chow Time!'","[Flame of Gluttony] Shoots flames at a designated target, dealing increasing Arts damage over time. If the target leaves the field, triggers an explosion at the target's former location, dealing significant Arts damage."],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":1000,"def":600,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"originium_slug_enemy_1007_slime_3":{"slug":"originium_slug_enemy_1007_slime_3","name":"Originium Slug β","icon":"/enemies-icons/Originium Slug β.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An infected wild creature that is more dangerous than an Originium Slug α. Due to their low intelligence, they are easily controlled by enemy casters for use as cannon fodder during invasions.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":1550,"atk":240,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.7}},"metal_crab":{"slug":"metal_crab","name":"Metal Crab","icon":"/enemies-icons/Metal Crab.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","d